    <main>
        <!-- HERO SECTION - Two Column Layout -->
        <section class="signature-hero">
            <div class="signature-hero-content">
                <a href="index.html#hero" class="back-home-link"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home</a>
                <h1>The Signature Journey</h1>
                <p class="signature-subtitle">10 Days to Touch the Soul of the Amalfi Coast</p>
                <p class="signature-description">Our Flagship Experience crafted for travelers who want more than a vacation. An immersive journey through the true essence of the Amalfi Coast.</p>
                <div class="signature-hero-cta">
                    <a href="amalfi-journey.html" class="btn-primary-large">View the Full Journey →</a>
                    <a href="#signature-dates" class="btn-secondary-large">View 2026 Dates →</a>
                    <a href="#signature-why" class="btn-secondary-large">Learn More →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-hero-image">
                <img src="imagenes/signature journey.jpg" alt="Amalfi Coast panoramic view">
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- WHY SIGNATURE JOURNEY -->
        <section id="signature-why" class="signature-why-section">
            <div class="signature-why-wrapper">
                <div class="signature-why-content">
                    <h2>Why the Signature Journey?</h2>
                    
                    <p>Our Signature Journey is Tocca Amalfi Coast's flagship immersion, designed for <em>travelers who want to uncover the true essence of the Coast</em>: its spirit, its flavors, its people, and the quiet magic that lives between the cliffs and the sea.</p>
                    
                    <p>Across <em>10 unforgettable days,</em> you will not only see the Coast; you will touch its soul through curated experiences, private connections, and a rhythm of slow, intentional travel that lets every moment breathe.</p>
                    
                    <div class="signature-features-grid">
                        <div class="signature-feature">
                            <i class="fas fa-hotel"></i>
                            <p>Boutique hotels with sea-view terraces</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="signature-feature">
                            <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
                            <p>Local hosts who open their homes, kitchens, and stories</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="signature-feature">
                            <i class="fas fa-gem"></i>
                            <p>Exclusive experiences impossible to access on your own</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="signature-feature">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <p>A seamless flow - every detail handled for you</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p>Every day unveils a different layer of the Amalfi Coast and beyond - from the pastel villages of Positano and Amalfi to the quiet beauty of Maiori, Minori, Atrani, Ravello, Tramonti, Praiano, Conca dei Marini, and the island of Capri & Pompeii</p>
                    
                    <p>You will discover the Coast's flavors, landscapes, and traditions in a soft balance of culture, movement, and pure Mediterranean joy.</p>
                    
                    <h3>This journey is perfect for travelers who want:</h3>
                    <ul class="journey-perfect-for">
                        <li><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> Authentic connection</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-palette"></i> Curated beauty</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check"></i> Zero planning</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-concierge-bell"></i> High-touch service</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-sun"></i> A soul-deep travel experience</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                </div>
                
                <div class="signature-why-visual-column">
                    <div class="signature-why-carousel">
                    <div class="carousel-container">
                        <div class="carousel-slide active">
                            <img src="imagenesparapaginas/carruselsignature1.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Coast view" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide">
                            <img src="imagenesparapaginas/carruselsignature2.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Coast gardens" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide">
                            <img src="imagenesparapaginas/carruselsignature3.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Coast village" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide">
                            <img src="imagenesparapaginas/carruselsignature4.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Coast harbor" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide">
                            <img src="imagenesparapaginas/carruselsignature5.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Coast rocks" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button class="carousel-btn prev" onclick="moveCarousel(-1)">&#10094;</button>
                    <button class="carousel-btn next" onclick="moveCarousel(1)">&#10095;</button>
                    <div class="carousel-dots">
                        <span class="dot active" onclick="currentSlide(1)"></span>
                        <span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(2)"></span>
                        <span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(3)"></span>
                        <span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(4)"></span>
                        <span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(5)"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                    <div class="signature-placeholder-image">
                        <img src="imagenes/views.jpg" alt="Amalfi Coast Views" loading="lazy">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- STAMP OVERLAY -->
            <div class="signature-stamp-overlay">
                <div class="stamp-content">
                    <p>This is more than a trip. It's an invitation to live the Coast.</p>
                    <div class="signature-cta-buttons signature-cta-buttons--stamp">
                        <a href="#" class="btn-primary-large" onclick="openRequestModal(); return false;">Interest? Let's connect →</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- WHAT AWAITS YOU -->
        <section class="signature-experiences-section">
            <div class="signature-container">
                <h2>What Awaits You</h2>
                <p class="experiences-intro">Immerse yourself in the authentic soul of the Amalfi Coast</p>
                
                <div class="signature-experiences-grid">
                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/lemongroves.jpeg" alt="Hands harvesting Amalfi lemons" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Lemon Groves &amp; Limoncello Making</h3>
                            <p>Walk the terraces with local growers and craft your own limoncello straight from the source.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/oliveoiltasting.jpeg" alt="Tasting premium olive oils" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Olive Groves &amp; Olive Oil Tasting</h3>
                            <p>Savor liquid gold while learning the art of pressing from families who have tended these groves for generations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/cookingclass.jpeg" alt="Cooking with seasonal ingredients" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Cooking Class</h3>
                            <p>Create multi-course coastal dishes with a local chef and gather around the table to enjoy them.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Ceramic.jpeg" alt="Decorative ceramics inspiration" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Ceramic Making Workshop</h3>
                            <p>Shape and glaze vibrant Vietri-inspired pieces to bring a touch of the coast home.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Privateboats.jpeg" alt="Private boat cruising the Amalfi Coast" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Private Boat Day</h3>
                            <p>Set your own course on a private vessel, stopping for swims in crystalline coves.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Vineyardandwinetasting.jpeg" alt="Vineyard on the Amalfi Coast" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Vineyard &amp; Wine Tasting</h3>
                            <p>Sip rare vintages in hillside cellars and meet the winemakers behind each bottle.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/dinning.jpeg" alt="Dining with coastal views and local wine" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Dining Above and On the Sea</h3>
                            <p>Lunches and dinners with unlimited local wine, coastal views, and stunning cliffside settings right above the sea.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Pompei.jpg" alt="Exploring Pompeii ruins" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Pompeii</h3>
                            <p>Walk the storied streets of Pompeii with an archaeological guide illuminating every detail.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/positano.jpeg" alt="Colorful Positano cliffs" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Positano</h3>
                            <p>Climb the vibrant stairways of Positano and browse chic boutiques tucked into the cliffs.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/amalfi.jpeg" alt="Amalfi Cathedral façade" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Amalfi</h3>
                            <p>Discover Amalfi's maritime legacy and its striking cathedral overlooking the piazza.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Ravello.jpeg" alt="Villa Rufolo gardens in Ravello" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Ravello</h3>
                            <p>Lose yourself in Ravello's cliffside villas, famed gardens, and open-air concerts.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Atrani.jpg" alt="Atrani coastline" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Atrani</h3>
                            <p>Wander the winding alleys of Atrani, Italy's smallest seaside village.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Capri.jpeg" alt="Capri island day trip" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Capri Island Day</h3>
                            <p>Sail to Capri for chic piazzettas, hidden coves, and the legendary Blue Grotto.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Maiori_ Amalfi_Coast_Italy.jpg" alt="View over Maiori" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Maiori</h3>
                            <p>Your home base with golden beaches, authentic restaurants, and local charm.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="experience-card">
                        <img src="imagenesparapaginas/Bay_of_Conca_di_Marini_Amalfi_Coast.jpeg" alt="Conca dei Marini bay" loading="lazy">
                        <div class="experience-card-content">
                            <h3>Conca dei Marini</h3>
                            <p>Take in sweeping vistas and the famed Emerald Grotto in picturesque Conca dei Marini.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <p class="experiences-closing-note" style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #5a5a5a; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 1.1rem;">Just a taste of your Signature Journey. Many more handcrafted moments await.</p>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 15px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="amalfi-journey.html" class="btn-primary-large">View the Full Journey →</a>
                    <a href="#signature-dates" class="btn-secondary-large">Check 2026 Availability →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

